{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Tnode.Weak_table</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"arrayjit","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Ir","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Tnode","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Weak_table","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>A table whose entries go with their key node (gh-ocannl-1859): what a pass records about a node lasts exactly as long as the node, however long the session, so nothing has to clear it and code holding the node keeps the record. The value may refer to the key: that keeps neither alive. Its <code>length</code> counts entries the GC has not swept out yet, so <a href=\"../index.html#val-live_entries\"><code>live_entries</code></a> is what a census reads.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-key\"><a href=\"#type-key\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> key</span><span> = <a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>!'a t</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-create\"><a href=\"#val-create\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> create : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-clear\"><a href=\"#val-clear\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> clear : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arro